<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to Sprintly</title>
    <style>
      body { 
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif; 
        background: #f7f7f7; 
        color: #333; 
        margin: 0; 
        padding: 20px; 
      }
      .container { 
        max-width: 500px; 
        width: 100%;
        margin: 40px auto; 
        background: #fff; 
        padding: 30px; 
        border-radius: 8px; 
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); 
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      .header-title {
        color: #007bff;
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      .account-card {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 15px 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }
      .account-item {
        margin: 8px 0;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .account-label {
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #555;
      }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        background: #007bff;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-top: 15px;
      }
      .footer { 
        margin-top: 30px; 
        font-size: 12px; 
        color: #888; 
      }
      /* Mobile Responsiveness */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        body {
          padding: 10px;
        }
        .container {
          margin: 10px auto;
          padding: 20px;
        }
        .btn {
          display: block;
          text-align: center;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="header-title">Welcome to Sprintly!</h2>
      <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
      <p>We're thrilled to have you onboard! Your account has been officially registered and verified.</p>
      
      <div class="account-card">
        <div class="account-item">
          <span class="account-label">Account Name:</span> <%= name %>
        </div>
        <div class="account-item">
          <span class="account-label">Registered Email:</span> <%= email %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>You can now log in to explore your dashboard and get started with all our features.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reply directly to this email.</p>
      
      <div class="footer">&copy; Sprintly. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>